    "description": "COMICO\r\nTime to meet webtoon & web novel life work\r\n\r\n1. Exclusive webtoons by day of the week\r\nMonday Tuesday Wednesday Thursday Friday Saturday Sunday\r\nMeet webtoons updated daily!\r\n\r\n2. Exclusive new web novel\r\nNoble Comics original 'web novel'\r\nMeet the 'original'!\r\n\r\n3. From free benefits to mission rewards\r\nthrough various missions.\r\nGet free tickets and free coins!\r\n\r\n\r\n[Selective Access Rights Guide]\r\n- Phone: Maintain device authentication status and check cell phone status\r\n- Camera, photo: Save and read content / Take photos and attach files when writing a profile or inquiry\r\nEven if you do not agree to the optional access right, you can use the service except for the right.\r\n\r\n[Customer Support]\r\n- Customer Inquiry: help@comico.kr\r\n- Representative number: 1600-0314",
